  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9709.01 Public Records. All grant applications and records maintained by the department shall be public records subject to RSA 91-A, et seq.\n\nSource. #13338, INTERIM, eff 1-29-22, EXPIRES: 7-28-22; ss by #13365, eff 4-18-22\n\nAPPENDIX",
